From 7956fb1e11494b64a3dbf48cd5f6900cead669bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Mar 2022 12:02:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 038/151] arm64: dts: renesas: r8a779f0-vc4: dt overlay based
 phy mux setup

Modify r8a779f0-vc4.dts:
- add nodes for two PHYs per TSN,
- mark all PHYs disabled,
- remove phy-handle links for TSNs.

Introduce dt overlays that set up PHY mux. Each overlay:
- configures needed gpio hogs,
- configures phy-handle link,
- enables selected PHY.

Signed-off-by: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>
